# The same test environment with the newest click that rasterio's published requirement (`click>=4.0,!=8.2.*`) accepts:
# a rasterio failure that passes here and fails with click 8.2.1 is click-attributable. Locked per architecture:
#   uv pip compile --generate-hashes --python-version 3.12 --python-platform <arch>-manylinux_2_28 \
#     scripts/native/test-requirements-newclick.in -o scripts/native/test-requirements-newclick-<arch>.txt
-r test-requirements-base.in
click>=4.0,!=8.2.*
